  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching aim of the Tensions Monitoring System project is to inform key actors with context-specific and evidence-based analysis to guide conflict sensitive decision making, programming and policy development.  The system seeks to continuously strengthen and evolve a collective understanding of tension and drivers of tensions.</narrative>
